  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Channeling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it can't regain Hit Points until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).</p>\n<p><strong>midi-qol</strong>: No macros required. Melee spell attack deals 1d10 Necrotic (cantrip scaling). On hit, applies a Blocked Healing effect that grants immunity to healing damage type, expiring at end of caster's next turn via DAE specialDuration.</p>",
      "chat": "<p>Channeling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it can't regain Hit Points until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).</p>"
